<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings rates Van Ommeren as Buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings rates Van Ommeren as Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 23 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector-------- Price---  Broker-------------</p>
<p>Van Ommeren  Shipping/storage  63.50  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Long-term Buy. Improved earnings not yet refelected in price. Target 75 guilders, upgrade of relative P/E. Growth fuelled by Asia investment. Rhine results to improve sharply.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	5.24    (n/a)    12.2     2.00</p>
<p>    1996 (estimate)    6.00    unch     10.5     2.40</p>
<p>    1997 (estimate)    7.00    unch	9.0     2.80</p>
<p>    1998 (estimate)    8.00    (n/a)     7.9     3.20</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
